<task id="036" project="customer-provisioning-orchestration-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>Scaffold NEW .NET 10 project Sprk.Provisioning.ControlPlane — Program.cs + Startup + DI + JWT bearer + Operator/Reader auth + OpenAPI at /swagger</title>
    <phase>C Wave C3 — L2 Control-Plane Scaffold</phase>
    <gate>startable</gate>
    <status>not-started</status>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <rigor-reason>Net-new .NET 10 project scaffold + auth tag (JWT bearer + app-role authorization); every downstream handler + REST endpoint depends on this scaffold. task-create Step 3.5.5 FULL (auth tag; l2-controlplane tag; NEW surface; &gt;5 downstream deps).</rigor-reason>
    <model-tier>opus</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Brief rubric: L2 scaffold is high-blast-radius (net-new project scaffold); DI + auth + endpoint-filter architecture must be right first time because 19 handlers + 8 REST endpoints + state-reconciler all consume it. "Opus 4.8 / Fable 5 for L2 scaffold + UAMI migration + reconciler".</model-tier-reason>
    <effort>high</effort>
    <parallel-group>waveC3-scaffold</parallel-group>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
